sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant C as Client<br/>(React / Swift)
    participant H as AuthHandler<br/>(Go API)
    participant S as AuthService
    participant R as UserRepo
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>C: Enter username/password
    C->>H: POST /api/auth/login
    H->>S: Login(username, password)
    S->>R: GetByUsername(username)
    R->>DB: SELECT * FROM users
    DB-->>R: user row
    R-->>S: User
    S->>S: bcrypt.CompareHashAndPassword(password, hash)
    alt password correct
        S->>S: issueToken(userID, "access", 15m)<br/>issueToken(userID, "refresh", 7d)<br/>(stateless JWTs, not stored server-side)
        S-->>H: accessToken, refreshToken
        H-->>C: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken }
        C-->>U: Navigate to workspace (drive)
    else password incorrect
        S-->>H: ErrInvalidCredentials
        H-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
        C-->>U: Show error message
    end
